+```curl
+curl https://api.stripe.com/v1/setup_intents \
+  -u "<<YOUR_SECRET_KEY>>:" \
+  -d "customer_account={{CUSTOMERACCOUNT_ID}}" \
+  -d confirm=true \
+  -d "payment_method_data[type]=nz_bank_account" \
